    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present 1 Knocknarea Road to the market, a beautiful two-bedroom semi-detached property set on a prime corner site in the heart of Drimnagh. \n\nMeasuring approximately 61 sq. m/ 657 Sq. Ft, this fine property comes to the market in great condition throughout, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers and investors alike. \n\nCrucially, the expansive corner plot offers great potential for extension (subject to planning permission) to create a substantial forever home.\n\nLocated in a mature and sought-after neighbourhood, the property benefits from an exceptional array of local amenities on its doorstep, including shops, cafes, schools, and local parks, while also being within close proximity to Rialto and Crumlin Village.\n\nUpon entering, you are greeted by a bright entrance hallway. Off this lies a cosy living room. Moving through to the kitchen/ dining offering a fully equipped kitchen which gives you acces to the rear garden. Upstairs, the accommodation comprises of two well proportioned double bedrooms and the bathroom. \n\nOutside, the property boasts a sunny and generous rear garden complete with a convenient wooden shed. The standout feature is the broad side corner site, presenting a rare opportunity to significantly expand the living space (S.P.P.).\n\nKnocknarea Road enjoys an exceptionally convenient location within walking distance of a wealth of local amenities including schools, shops, cafés and sporting facilities. Excellent transport links are close by with the Red LUAS line, multiple Dublin Bus routes and the M50 all easily accessible, providing swift access to Dublin City Centre and beyond.\n\nThis is a fantastic opportunity to acquire a home with outstanding potential in one of Dublin 12's most established and convenient residential locations."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nLiving Room - 2.99m x 2.74m\n\n\nKitchen - 3.50m x 2.26m\n\n\nDining Area - 3.50m x 2.68m\n\n\nBedroom - 3.97m x 3.48m\n\n\nBedroom - 3.17m x 2.76m\n\n\nBathroom - 1.73m x 1.66m\n\n\n"
